{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43281","headline":"洛出书 · 郭邕","name":"洛出书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"德合天贶呈，龙飞圣人作。\n光宅被寰区，图书荐河洛。\n象登四气顺，文辟九畴错。\n氤氲瑞彩浮，左右灵仪廓。\n微造功不宰，神行利攸博。\n一见皇家庆，方知禹功薄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43281.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43281","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}